WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.700
- Calling all cars. We
got a honey. Eight seven.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.980
A Massachusetts' beekeeper
is facing felony assault

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:07.500
and battery charges after
she allegedly unleashed hell

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.000
on a group of local police officers

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.680
who were serving an eviction notice.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:12.287
Hell in the form of bees

00:00:12.287 --> 00:00:13.120
(bees swarming noises)
- My eyes! Ah!

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:16.020
- Rory Woods was one of several people

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:17.850
protesting the eviction of a local woman.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:18.930
But before the police arrived,

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:21.120
Woods camped out at the
eviction site in an SUV,

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.680
towing several beehives.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:23.513
When the police arrived,

00:00:23.513 --> 00:00:25.920
Woods put on a beekeeper
suit and opened the cage.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:27.780
A bee allegedly stung
an officer in the face

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:29.640
and when the officer said
he was allergic to bees,

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:30.697
Wood allegedly haunted him,

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:32.460
"Oh, you're allergic? Good."

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:34.230
Police said four officers
were stung by bees

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:36.240
and three of those officers were allergic.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.370
A prosecutor charged Woods
with four counts of assault

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.620
and battery with a dangerous
weapon, and three counts

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:43.350
of assault with a dangerous
weapon and disorderly conduct.

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:46.410
These charges would net Woods
10 to 15 years in prison.

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:48.150
Now this would be a great law school hypo.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:49.200
Bees are wild animals.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.570
Is a big keeper even
responsible for their actions?

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:53.730
Yes, under these circumstances she is.

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:56.703
So be careful when you get
involved in a sting operation.

